      "content": "First, download the `vortex-cli` binary from the internal repository and ensure it is executable using `chmod +x vortex-cli`. Next, add the CLI's directory to your system's PATH environment variable so it can be called globally. Finally, initialize the deployment engine and bootstrap your environment by running the command: `vortex init`. This sequence quickly gets VortexScale operational on your Linux machine.",
      "source": "target",
